abstract: >-
  RabiesAnalyzerRus is a program designed to analyze the
  genomes of Lyssavirus rabies and to identify genetic
  clusters based on the N and G genes SNP profiles, as well
  as to validate the genomes (by searching for stop codons
  and mistakes in each gene).
